	(text "================\nCCGM1A1 Characteristics\n================\nVDDIO = 1.1~2.7V (I/O supply voltage (GPIO banks and VDD_CLK))\nVDDcore = 0.85~1.15V (Core supply voltage (VDD, VDD_PLL, VDD_SER and VDD_SER_PLL))\nVDDSER = 0.95~1.15V (SerDes supply voltage (VDD_SER))\nVDDSER_PLL = 0.95~1.15V (SerDes PLL supply voltage (VDD_SER_PLL))"
